tr:

'<p class="l-text"><strong>GroupBy, Pandas\'taki en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc kavramd\u0131r.</strong> Verinizi gruplara ay\u0131rman\u0131za, her gruba ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z olarak bir fonksiyon uygulaman\u0131za ve sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 tek bir yap\u0131da birle\u015ftirmenize olanak tan\u0131r. Kategori bazl\u0131 istatistikler hesapl\u0131yor, grup i\u00e7i \u00f6znitelikleri normalize ediyor veya ML i\u00e7in \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi yap\u0131yor olun -- <code>groupby()</code> her\u015feyin merkezindedir.</p>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Bu ders, t\u00fcm groupby ekosistemini kapsar: <strong>toplula\u015ft\u0131rma</strong> (gruplar\u0131 skaler de\u011ferlere indirgeme), <strong>d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme</strong> (ayn\u0131 boyutta \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131 \u00fcretme), <strong>filtreleme</strong> (t\u00fcm gruplar\u0131 tutma/b\u0131rakma), <strong>pivot tablolar</strong>, <strong>\u00e7apraz tablolar</strong> ve hareketli istatistikler i\u00e7in <strong>pencere fonksiyonlar\u0131</strong>.</p>'
+ '<div class="lesson-outcomes" style="background:rgba(200,169,110,0.06);border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><div style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:0.6rem">📍 BU DERSTE ÖĞRENECEKSİN</div><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(235,230,220,0.92)"><li>DataFrame.groupby() ile satırları bir veya birden çok sütuna göre grupla</li><li>sum, mean, count ve özel fonksiyonlarla .agg() üzerinden grupları topla</li><li>Tek çağrıda birden çok sütuna birden çok agregasyon uygula</li><li>Grup-seviyesindeki istatistikleri satırlara yaymak için .transform() kullan</li><li>Grup-bazlı predicate\'lere göre grupları .filter() ile süz</li><li>Grup başına Top-N almak için groupby\'ı sort, rank ve head ile birleştir</li></ul></div>'


/* ============================================================
   SECTION 1: B\u00f6l-Uygula-Birle\u015ftir
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">1. B\u00f6l-Uygula-Birle\u015ftir (Split-Apply-Combine)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Paradigma:</strong> Her <code>groupby()</code> i\u015flemi ayn\u0131 \u00fc\u00e7 ad\u0131ml\u0131 deseni izler: (1) DataFrame\'i bir veya daha fazla anahtara g\u00f6re gruplara <strong>B\u00f6l</strong>, (2) Her gruba ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z olarak bir fonksiyon <strong>Uygula</strong>, (3) Sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 tek bir DataFrame veya Series\'e <strong>Birle\u015ftir</strong>. Buna <em>B\u00f6l-Uygula-Birle\u015ftir</em> stratejisi denir.</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">B\u00f6l (Split)</div><div class="card-body"><code>df.groupby("col")</code> bir GroupBy nesnesi olu\u015fturur. Hen\u00fcz hesaplama yap\u0131lmaz -- <strong>tembel</strong> (lazy) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Sadece verilerin s\u00fctundaki benzersiz de\u011ferlere g\u00f6re nas\u0131l b\u00f6l\u00fcnece\u011fini kaydeder.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Uygula (Apply)</div><div class="card-body">GroupBy nesnesi \u00fczerinde bir toplula\u015ft\u0131rma (<code>.mean()</code>), d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme (<code>.transform()</code>) veya filtre (<code>.filter()</code>) \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131n. Fonksiyon her grup \u00fczerinde ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Birle\u015ftir (Combine)</div><div class="card-body">Pandas sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 otomatik olarak yeniden birle\u015ftirir. Toplula\u015ft\u0131rmalar daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck bir DataFrame \u00fcretir (grup ba\u015f\u0131na bir sat\u0131r). D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrmeler giri\u015fle ayn\u0131 boyutu d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">GroupBy Nesnesini Olu\u015ftür</div><div class="step-detail"><code>grouped = df.groupby("field")</code> -- Bu bir <strong>DataFrameGroupBy</strong> nesnesi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr, DataFrame de\u011fil. Bunu, "field"\'in her benzersiz de\u011feri i\u00e7in bir tane olmak \u00fczere, alt-DataFrame\'ler koleksiyonu olarak d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Gruplar\u0131 \u0130ncele</div><div class="step-detail"><code>grouped.groups</code> grup anahtarlar\u0131n\u0131 sat\u0131r indekslerine e\u015fleyen bir s\u00f6zl\u00fck d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. <code>grouped.ngroups</code> ka\u00e7 grup oldu\u011funu s\u00f6yler. <code>grouped.get_group("NLP")</code> belirli bir grubun alt-DataFrame\'ini d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Fonksiyon Uygula</div><div class="step-detail"><code>.mean()</code>, <code>.sum()</code>, <code>.agg()</code>, <code>.transform()</code> veya <code>.filter()</code> \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131n. Her fonksiyon t\u00fcm gruplarda ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r, ard\u0131ndan Pandas sonu\u00e7lar\u0131 otomatik olarak birle\u015ftirir.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00d6rnek veri seti: alanlar\u0131 ve puanlar\u0131 olan \u00f6\u011frenciler</span>\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"name"</span>:  [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>, <span class="str">"Grace"</span>, <span class="str">"Hank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"field"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>: [<span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">85</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">76</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">79</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">82</span>],\n    <span class="str">"hours"</span>: [<span class="num">40</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">38</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">45</span>, <span class="num">32</span>, <span class="num">42</span>, <span class="num">28</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Ad\u0131m 1: GroupBy nesnesi olu\u015ftur (tembel -- hesaplama yok)</span>\ngrouped = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">type</span>(grouped))   <span class="cm"># DataFrameGroupBy</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Gruplar\u0131 incele</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(grouped.ngroups)          <span class="cm"># 3 (CV, DL, NLP)</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(grouped.groups)           <span class="cm"># {\'CV\': [1,3,7], \'DL\': [4,6], \'NLP\': [0,2,5]}</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(grouped.<span class="fn">size</span>())           <span class="cm"># CV: 3, DL: 2, NLP: 3</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Ad\u0131m 2: Belirli bir grubu al</span>\nnlp_group = grouped.<span class="fn">get_group</span>(<span class="str">"NLP"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(nlp_group)\n\n<span class="cm"># Ad\u0131m 3: Toplula\u015ft\u0131rma uygula</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(grouped[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>())\n<span class="cm"># field</span>\n<span class="cm"># CV     81.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># DL     93.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># NLP    86.333...</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Birden fazla s\u00fctuna g\u00f6re gruplama</strong> sonu\u00e7ta bir MultiIndex olu\u015fturur:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># \u00c7oklu s\u00fctun groupby</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"level"</span>] = [<span class="str">"grad"</span>, <span class="str">"undergrad"</span>, <span class="str">"grad"</span>, <span class="str">"undergrad"</span>,\n               <span class="str">"grad"</span>, <span class="str">"undergrad"</span>, <span class="str">"grad"</span>, <span class="str">"undergrad"</span>]\n\nmulti = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>([<span class="str">"field"</span>, <span class="str">"level"</span>])[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n<span class="fn">print</span>(multi)\n\n<span class="cm"># Gruplar \u00fczerinde d\u00f6ng\u00fc</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> name, group <span class="kw">in</span> df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>):\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="kw">f</span><span class="str">"--- {name} (n={len(group)}) ---"</span>)\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(group[[<span class="str">"name"</span>, <span class="str">"score"</span>]])</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: B\u00f6l-Uygula-Birle\u015ftir G\u00f6rselle\u015ftirme TR --- */
