+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Her \u00e7ubuk bir \u00f6\u011frencinin puan\u0131n\u0131 temsil eder, alanlar\u0131na g\u00f6re renklendirilmi\u015ftir. Kesikli yatay \u00e7izgiler <code>.mean()</code> uyguland\u0131ktan sonraki grup ortalamas\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6sterir. Bu, B\u00f6l-Uygula-Birle\u015ftir deseninin eylemdeki halidir.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="think-box"><div class="think-label">D\u00dc\u015e\u00dcN\u00dcN</div><div class="think-body">GroupBy nesnesi <strong>tembel</strong>dir (lazy) -- olu\u015fturmak neredeyse hi\u00e7 maliyetsizdir. Hesaplama yaln\u0131zca bir toplula\u015ft\u0131rma veya d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme \u00e7a\u011f\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131zda ger\u00e7ekle\u015fir. Bu, <code>grouped = df.groupby("col")</code> yazarak performans kayb\u0131 olmadan birden \u00e7ok kez yeniden kullanabilece\u011finiz anlam\u0131na gelir.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 2: Toplula\u015ft\u0131rma (Aggregation)
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Toplula\u015ft\u0131rma (Aggregation)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Toplula\u015ft\u0131rma, her grubu tek bir de\u011fere indirger.</strong> <code>.agg()</code> metodu en esnek toplula\u015ft\u0131rma arac\u0131d\u0131r -- tek bir \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131da bir veya daha fazla fonksiyon uygulaman\u0131za, \u00f6zel fonksiyonlar kullanman\u0131za ve \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131 s\u00fctunlar\u0131n\u0131 yeniden adland\u0131rman\u0131za olanak tan\u0131r.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Yerle\u015fik toplula\u015ft\u0131rma fonksiyonlar\u0131</strong> -- bunlar \u00f6zel Python fonksiyonlar\u0131ndan \u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131 olan optimize edilmi\u015f C-seviyesi uygulamalar\u0131d\u0131r:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">sum / mean</div><div class="card-body"><code>.sum()</code> t\u00fcm de\u011ferleri toplar. <code>.mean()</code> aritmetik ortalamay\u0131 hesaplar. Her ikisi de varsay\u0131lan olarak NaN\'lar\u0131 atlar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">count / size</div><div class="card-body"><code>.count()</code> s\u00fctun ba\u015f\u0131na NaN olmayan de\u011ferleri sayar. <code>.size()</code> NaN dahil t\u00fcm sat\u0131rlar\u0131 sayar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">min / max</div><div class="card-body"><code>.min()</code> ve <code>.max()</code> u\u00e7 de\u011ferleri d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Say\u0131lar, stringler (alfabetik) ve tarihlerle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">std / var</div><div class="card-body"><code>.std()</code> standart sapma, <code>.var()</code> varyans. Varsay\u0131lan <code>ddof=1</code>\'dir (\u00f6rneklem). Pop\u00fclasyon i\u00e7in <code>.std(ddof=0)</code> kullan\u0131n.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">first / last</div><div class="card-body"><code>.first()</code> grup ba\u015f\u0131na ilk NaN olmayan de\u011feri d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. <code>.last()</code> sonuncuyu d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Zaman serisi verileri i\u00e7in kullan\u0131\u015fl\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">median / quantile</div><div class="card-body"><code>.median()</code> 50. y\u00fczdelik dilimi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. <code>.quantile(0.75)</code> istedi\u011finiz herhangi bir y\u00fczdelik dilimi d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"name"</span>:  [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>, <span class="str">"Grace"</span>, <span class="str">"Hank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"field"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>: [<span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">85</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">76</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">79</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">82</span>],\n    <span class="str">"hours"</span>: [<span class="num">40</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">38</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">45</span>, <span class="num">32</span>, <span class="num">42</span>, <span class="num">28</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Tekli toplula\u015ft\u0131rma -- k\u0131sayol metotlar\u0131</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>())\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">std</span>())\n\n<span class="cm"># Birden fazla toplula\u015ft\u0131rma .agg() ile</span>\nresult = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">agg</span>([<span class="str">"mean"</span>, <span class="str">"std"</span>, <span class="str">"min"</span>, <span class="str">"max"</span>, <span class="str">"count"</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(result)\n<span class="cm">#         mean       std  min  max  count</span>\n<span class="cm"># field</span>\n<span class="cm"># CV     81.00  4.582...   76   85      3</span>\n<span class="cm"># DL     93.00  2.828...   91   95      2</span>\n<span class="cm"># NLP    86.33  6.658...   79   92      3</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u00fctun ba\u015f\u0131na farkl\u0131 toplula\u015ft\u0131rmalar</span>\nresult = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>).<span class="fn">agg</span>({\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>: [<span class="str">"mean"</span>, <span class="str">"std"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"hours"</span>: [<span class="str">"sum"</span>, <span class="str">"mean"</span>]\n})\n<span class="fn">print</span>(result)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Adland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f toplula\u015ft\u0131rma</strong> -- temiz, d\u00fcz s\u00fctun adlar\u0131 elde etmenin modern yolu:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Adland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f toplula\u015ft\u0131rma (Pandas 0.25+)</span>\nresult = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>).<span class="fn">agg</span>(\n    ort_puan   = (<span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"mean"</span>),\n    max_puan   = (<span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"max"</span>),\n    toplam_saat = (<span class="str">"hours"</span>, <span class="str">"sum"</span>),\n    ogrenci_say = (<span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"count"</span>)\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(result)\n<span class="cm">#        ort_puan  max_puan  toplam_saat  ogrenci_say</span>\n<span class="cm"># field</span>\n<span class="cm"># CV        81.00        85           93            3</span>\n<span class="cm"># DL        93.00        95           87            2</span>\n<span class="cm"># NLP       86.33        92          110            3</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00d6zel toplula\u015ft\u0131rma fonksiyonlar\u0131</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">puan_araligi</span>(s):\n    <span class="kw">return</span> s.<span class="fn">max</span>() - s.<span class="fn">min</span>()\n\nresult = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">agg</span>(\n    [<span class="str">"mean"</span>, puan_araligi]\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(result)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Performans ipucu:</strong> Yerle\u015fik toplula\u015ft\u0131rmalar (<code>"mean"</code>, <code>"sum"</code> vb.) C/Cython\'da uygulanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve \u00f6zel Python fonksiyonlar\u0131ndan 10-100 kat daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r. \u00d6zel fonksiyon yazmadan \u00f6nce her zaman bir yerle\u015fik fonksiyonun olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 3: D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme ve Filtreleme
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme ve Filtreleme (Transform & Filter)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Transform ayn\u0131 boyutta \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131 d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr.</strong> <code>.agg()</code> her grubu bir sat\u0131ra indirgerken, <code>.transform()</code> orijinal DataFrame\'deki her sat\u0131r i\u00e7in bir de\u011fer d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Bu, <strong>grup i\u00e7i z-skor normalizasyonu</strong>, <strong>NaN\'lar\u0131 grup ortalamas\u0131yla doldurma</strong> veya <strong>grup i\u00e7i y\u00fczdeler hesaplama</strong> gibi i\u015flemler i\u00e7in \u00e7ok \u00f6nemlidir.</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">agg() -- \u0130ndirger</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00c7\u0131kt\u0131da grup ba\u015f\u0131na bir sat\u0131r vard\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Giri\u015f: 8 sat\u0131r, 3 grup &rarr; \u00c7\u0131kt\u0131: 3 sat\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Kullan\u0131m: \u00f6zet istatistikler, raporlama</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00d6rnek: alan ba\u015f\u0131na ortalama puan</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">transform() -- Ayn\u0131 Boyut</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00c7\u0131kt\u0131 giri\u015fle ayn\u0131 sat\u0131r say\u0131s\u0131na sahiptir</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Giri\u015f: 8 sat\u0131r &rarr; \u00c7\u0131kt\u0131: 8 sat\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Kullan\u0131m: normalizasyon, \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u00d6rnek: her alan i\u00e7inde z-skor</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"name"</span>:  [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>, <span class="str">"Grace"</span>, <span class="str">"Hank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"field"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"DL"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>: [<span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">85</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">76</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">79</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">82</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Grup i\u00e7i z-skor normalizasyonu</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"z_skor"</span>] = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">transform</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> x: (x - x.<span class="fn">mean</span>()) / x.<span class="fn">std</span>()\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[[<span class="str">"name"</span>, <span class="str">"field"</span>, <span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"z_skor"</span>]])\n\n<span class="cm"># Grup ortalamas\u0131n\u0131 her sat\u0131ra yay</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"grup_ort"</span>] = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">transform</span>(<span class="str">"mean"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Grup ortalamas\u0131ndan sapma</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"sapma"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"score"</span>] - df[<span class="str">"grup_ort"</span>]\n\n<span class="cm"># Grup toplam\u0131n\u0131n y\u00fczdesi</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"grup_yuzde"</span>] = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">transform</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x / x.<span class="fn">sum</span>() * <span class="num">100</span>\n)\n\n<span class="cm"># NaN\'lar\u0131 grup ortalamas\u0131yla doldur (\u00e7ok yayg\u0131n!)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"doldurulmus"</span>] = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">transform</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x.<span class="fn">fillna</span>(x.<span class="fn">mean</span>())\n)\n\n<span class="cm"># Grup i\u00e7i s\u0131ralama</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"grup_sira"</span>] = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>)[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">rank</span>(ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Grup filtreleme</strong> -- bir ko\u015fula g\u00f6re t\u00fcm gruplar\u0131 tut veya b\u0131rak:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># filter() fonksiyonun True d\u00f6nd\u00fcrd\u00fc\u011f\u00fc gruplar\u0131 tutar</span>\n<span class="cm"># Sadece ortalama puanı > 85 olan alanlar\u0131 tut</span>\nyuksek_ort = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>).<span class="fn">filter</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> g: g[<span class="str">"score"</span>].<span class="fn">mean</span>() > <span class="num">85</span>\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(yuksek_ort)\n<span class="cm"># Sadece NLP (86.3) ve DL (93.0) gruplar\u0131 kal\u0131r</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># En az 3 \u00fcyesi olan gruplar\u0131 tut</span>\nbuyuk_gruplar = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"field"</span>).<span class="fn">filter</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> g: <span class="fn">len</span>(g) >= <span class="num">3</span>\n)</code></pre></div>'

