+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. Pivot Tablolar</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Pivot tablolar, verileri uzun formattan geni\u015f formata yeniden \u015fekillendirir.</strong> groupby + toplula\u015ft\u0131rma + manuel yeniden \u015fekillendirme yerine, <code>pd.pivot_table()</code> her \u015feyi tek ad\u0131mda yapar. Excel\'in PivotTable \u00f6zelli\u011fi gibi, toplula\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f de\u011ferlerle bir \u00e7apraz tablo olu\u015fturur.</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># Pivot tablolar i\u00e7in daha b\u00fcy\u00fck veri seti</span>\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"student"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>,<span class="str">"Alice"</span>,<span class="str">"Alice"</span>,<span class="str">"Bob"</span>,<span class="str">"Bob"</span>,<span class="str">"Bob"</span>,\n                <span class="str">"Carol"</span>,<span class="str">"Carol"</span>,<span class="str">"Carol"</span>,<span class="str">"Dave"</span>,<span class="str">"Dave"</span>,<span class="str">"Dave"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"subject"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>,<span class="str">"CV"</span>,<span class="str">"DL"</span>]*<span class="num">4</span>,\n    <span class="str">"semester"</span>: [<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,<span class="str">"Fall"</span>,\n                 <span class="str">"Spring"</span>,<span class="str">"Spring"</span>,<span class="str">"Spring"</span>,<span class="str">"Spring"</span>,<span class="str">"Spring"</span>,<span class="str">"Spring"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>:   [<span class="num">92</span>,<span class="num">85</span>,<span class="num">88</span>,<span class="num">76</span>,<span class="num">90</span>,<span class="num">82</span>,<span class="num">95</span>,<span class="num">78</span>,<span class="num">91</span>,<span class="num">80</span>,<span class="num">88</span>,<span class="num">85</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Temel pivot tablo: \u00f6\u011frenciler sat\u0131rda, dersler s\u00fctunda</span>\npivot = pd.<span class="fn">pivot_table</span>(\n    df,\n    values=<span class="str">"score"</span>,\n    index=<span class="str">"student"</span>,\n    columns=<span class="str">"subject"</span>,\n    aggfunc=<span class="str">"mean"</span>\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(pivot)\n<span class="cm"># subject   CV    DL   NLP</span>\n<span class="cm"># student</span>\n<span class="cm"># Alice    85.0  88.0  92.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># Bob      90.0  82.0  76.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># Carol    78.0  91.0  95.0</span>\n<span class="cm"># Dave     88.0  85.0  80.0</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Toplamlar ve \u00e7oklu aggfunc ile</span>\npivot2 = pd.<span class="fn">pivot_table</span>(\n    df,\n    values=<span class="str">"score"</span>,\n    index=<span class="str">"student"</span>,\n    columns=<span class="str">"subject"</span>,\n    aggfunc=[<span class="str">"mean"</span>, <span class="str">"count"</span>],\n    margins=<span class="kw">True</span>,\n    margins_name=<span class="str">"Toplam"</span>\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(pivot2)</code></pre></div>'

