+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. \u00c7apraz Tablolama ve Gruplama (Cross Tabulation & Binning)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>\u00c7apraz tablolama, iki kategorik de\u011fi\u015fken i\u00e7in frekans tablosudur.</strong> Pivot tablolar say\u0131sal de\u011ferleri toplula\u015ft\u0131r\u0131rken, <code>pd.crosstab()</code> tekrar say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 sayar. "Her alandan ka\u00e7 \u00f6\u011frenci her not aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda puan ald\u0131?" gibi sorular\u0131 yan\u0131tlar.</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"student"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>,<span class="str">"Bob"</span>,<span class="str">"Carol"</span>,<span class="str">"Dave"</span>,<span class="str">"Eve"</span>,<span class="str">"Frank"</span>,<span class="str">"Grace"</span>,<span class="str">"Hank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"field"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>,<span class="str">"CV"</span>,<span class="str">"NLP"</span>,<span class="str">"CV"</span>,<span class="str">"DL"</span>,<span class="str">"NLP"</span>,<span class="str">"DL"</span>,<span class="str">"CV"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"level"</span>: [<span class="str">"grad"</span>,<span class="str">"undergrad"</span>,<span class="str">"grad"</span>,<span class="str">"undergrad"</span>,<span class="str">"grad"</span>,<span class="str">"undergrad"</span>,<span class="str">"grad"</span>,<span class="str">"undergrad"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"score"</span>: [<span class="num">92</span>,<span class="num">85</span>,<span class="num">88</span>,<span class="num">76</span>,<span class="num">95</span>,<span class="num">79</span>,<span class="num">91</span>,<span class="num">82</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Temel \u00e7apraz tablolama -- frekans say\u0131lar\u0131</span>\nctab = pd.<span class="fn">crosstab</span>(df[<span class="str">"field"</span>], df[<span class="str">"level"</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(ctab)\n<span class="cm"># level  grad  undergrad</span>\n<span class="cm"># field</span>\n<span class="cm"># CV        0          3</span>\n<span class="cm"># DL        2          0</span>\n<span class="cm"># NLP       2          1</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Normalize -- say\u0131 yerine oran</span>\nctab_pct = pd.<span class="fn">crosstab</span>(df[<span class="str">"field"</span>], df[<span class="str">"level"</span>], normalize=<span class="str">"index"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(ctab_pct.<span class="fn">round</span>(<span class="num">2</span>))\n<span class="cm"># normalize="index"    \u2192 sat\u0131r y\u00fczdeleri (sat\u0131r ba\u015f\u0131na 1\'e toplar)</span>\n<span class="cm"># normalize="columns" \u2192 s\u00fctun y\u00fczdeleri</span>\n<span class="cm"># normalize="all"     \u2192 toplam y\u00fczdeler</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>pd.cut() ve pd.qcut() ile gruplama</strong> -- s\u00fcrekli verileri kategorik gruplara d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcn:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># pd.cut() -- e\u015fit geni\u015flikte gruplar (kenarlar\u0131 siz belirlersiniz)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"not"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">cut</span>(\n    df[<span class="str">"score"</span>],\n    bins=[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">70</span>, <span class="num">80</span>, <span class="num">90</span>, <span class="num">100</span>],\n    labels=[<span class="str">"F"</span>, <span class="str">"D"</span>, <span class="str">"C"</span>, <span class="str">"B"</span>, <span class="str">"A"</span>]\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[[<span class="str">"student"</span>, <span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"not"</span>]])\n\n<span class="cm"># Not vs alan \u00e7apraz tablosu</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(pd.<span class="fn">crosstab</span>(df[<span class="str">"not"</span>], df[<span class="str">"field"</span>]))\n\n<span class="cm"># pd.qcut() -- e\u015fit frekans gruplar (her grupta e\u015fit say\u0131da eleman)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"ceyreklik"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">qcut</span>(df[<span class="str">"score"</span>], q=<span class="num">4</span>, labels=[<span class="str">"Q1"</span>,<span class="str">"Q2"</span>,<span class="str">"Q3"</span>,<span class="str">"Q4"</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[[<span class="str">"student"</span>, <span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"ceyreklik"</span>]])\n\n<span class="cm"># groupby + gruplama ile \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan_grubu"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">cut</span>(df[<span class="str">"score"</span>], bins=<span class="num">3</span>)\ngruop_stats = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"puan_grubu"</span>).<span class="fn">agg</span>(\n    sayi=(<span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"count"</span>),\n    ort_puan=(<span class="str">"score"</span>, <span class="str">"mean"</span>)\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(gruop_stats)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">pd.cut() -- E\u015fit Geni\u015flikte</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Grup kenarlar\u0131n\u0131 siz belirlersiniz: [0, 60, 80, 100]</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Her grubun ayn\u0131 geni\u015fli\u011fi vard\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Grup ba\u015f\u0131na farkl\u0131 say\u0131da eleman</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Kullan\u0131m: harf notlar\u0131, ya\u015f gruplar\u0131, fiyat aral\u0131klar\u0131</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">pd.qcut() -- E\u015fit Frekans</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ka\u00e7 b\u00f6l\u00fcm olaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirlersiniz: q=4</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Her grupta ayn\u0131 say\u0131da eleman</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Farkl\u0131 grup geni\u015flikleri</div>'
