+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">PRAT\u0130K: GroupBy ile \u00d6znitelik M\u00fchendisli\u011fi</div><div class="example-body">'
+ '<strong>NLP senaryosu:</strong> Kategorili yorumlardan olu\u015fan bir veri setiniz var. GroupBy ile \u00f6znitelik m\u00fchendisli\u011fi:<br>'
+ '<code>df["kategori_ort_uzunluk"] = df.groupby("kategori")["metin_uzunlugu"].transform("mean")</code> -- kategori ba\u015f\u0131na ortalama metin uzunlu\u011fu<br>'
+ '<code>df["goreceli_uzunluk"] = df["metin_uzunlugu"] / df["kategori_ort_uzunluk"]</code> -- g\u00f6receli uzunluk<br>'
+ '<code>df["kategori_duygu_sirasi"] = df.groupby("kategori")["duygu"].rank(pct=True)</code> -- kategori i\u00e7i y\u00fczdelik s\u0131ras\u0131<br>'
+ '<code>df["uzun_mu"] = df.groupby("kategori")["metin_uzunlugu"].transform(lambda x: x > x.quantile(0.9))</code> -- ayk\u0131r\u0131 de\u011fer bayra\u011f\u0131'
+ '</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 6: Pencere Fonksiyonlar\u0131
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Pencere Fonksiyonlar\u0131 (Window Functions)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Pencere fonksiyonlar\u0131, kayan bir veri penceresi \u00fczerinde istatistikler hesaplar.</strong> T\u00fcm grup i\u00e7in tek bir de\u011fer hesaplamak yerine, her sat\u0131r i\u00e7in \u00e7evredeki sat\u0131rlar\u0131n bir kom\u015fulu\u011funa dayal\u0131 bir de\u011fer hesaplarlar. Zaman serisi analizi, d\u00fczle\u015ftirme ve trend tespiti i\u00e7in vazge\u00e7ilmezdir.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Yuvarlanan ortalama (rolling mean) \u2014 son w g\u00f6zlemin ortalamas\u0131:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\bar{x}_t^{(w)} = \\frac{1}{w}\\sum_{i = t-w+1}^{t} x_i$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x_t^{(w)}</div><div class="card-body">t an\u0131ndaki yuvarlanan (kayar) ortalama; w boyutunda sabit bir pencere \u00fczerinde hesaplan\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">w</div><div class="card-body">Pencere uzunlu\u011fu. B\u00fcy\u00fck w = daha d\u00fcz, de\u011fi\u015fimlere yava\u015f tepki; k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck w = daha g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fcl\u00fc ama daha duyarl\u0131.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Toplam aral\u0131\u011f\u0131</div><div class="card-body">t\u2212w+1\'den t\'ye \u2014 ge\u00e7erli olan\u0131 dahil en son w g\u00f6zlem. Pencere her ad\u0131mda bir ad\u0131m ileri kayar.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u0130lk w\u22121 NaN</div><div class="card-body">\u0130lk w\u22121 zaman ad\u0131m\u0131nda yeterli ge\u00e7mi\u015f yoktur, pandas varsay\u0131lan olarak NaN d\u00f6ner.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">E\u015fit a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131klar</div><div class="card-body">Penceredeki her g\u00f6zlem 1/w katk\u0131 verir. T\u00fcm noktalar e\u015fit \u00f6nemde \u2014 azalma yok. EWM (sonraki form\u00fcl) bunu giderir.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>\u00dcstel A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 Hareketli Ortalama (EWM) \u2014 azalmal\u0131, \u00f6zyinelemeli d\u00fczle\u015ftirme:</strong></p>'
+ '<div class="katex-block">$$\\bar{x}_t = \\alpha\\, x_t + (1 - \\alpha)\\, \\bar{x}_{t-1}$$</div>'
+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x_t</div><div class="card-body">t an\u0131ndaki EWM de\u011feri. Her yeni tahmin, yeni g\u00f6zlem ile \u00f6nceki tahminin a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 kar\u0131\u015f\u0131m\u0131d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x_t</div><div class="card-body">t an\u0131ndaki taze g\u00f6zlem. \u03b1 ile a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">x_{t\u22121}</div><div class="card-body">Bir \u00f6nceki EWM de\u011feri. \u00d6nceki t\u00fcm g\u00f6zlemlerin azalan bir haf\u0131zas\u0131n\u0131 zaten i\u00e7inde ta\u015f\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u03b1 (alpha)</div><div class="card-body">D\u00fczle\u015ftirme katsay\u0131s\u0131, (0, 1] aral\u0131\u011f\u0131nda. \u03b1 1\'e yak\u0131n = h\u0131zl\u0131 tepki, neredeyse d\u00fczle\u015ftirme yok; \u03b1 0\'a yak\u0131n = \u00e7ok d\u00fcz, yava\u015f tepki. Pandas span s al\u0131r, \u03b1 = 2/(s+1).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">Neden \u00fcstel</div><div class="card-body">\u00d6zyineleme a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda k. ge\u00e7mi\u015f g\u00f6zleme \u03b1\u00b7(1\u2212\u03b1)^k a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 d\u00fc\u015fer \u2014 geometrik olarak k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fcl\u00fcr. Eski veriler kendili\u011finden silinir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">ML\'de kullan\u0131m</div><div class="card-body">Adam/RMSProp optimizasyon algoritmalar\u0131 gradyana EWM uygular; batch norm \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan istatistikler i\u00e7in EWM kullan\u0131r; finansal g\u00f6stergelerdeki EMA tam olarak budur.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">rolling()</div><div class="card-body">Sabit boyutlu kayan pencere. <code>df["col"].rolling(window=7).mean()</code> 7 g\u00fcnl\u00fck hareketli ortalamay\u0131 hesaplar. \u0130lk <code>window-1</code> de\u011fer NaN\'d\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">expanding()</div><div class="card-body">Ba\u015flang\u0131\u00e7tan b\u00fcy\u00fcyen k\u00fcm\u00fclatif pencere. <code>.expanding().mean()</code> \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan ortalamay\u0131 hesaplar. Zaman i\u00e7inde birikimli istatistikler i\u00e7in idealdir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">ewm()</div><div class="card-body">\u00dcssel a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 pencere. Son de\u011ferlere daha fazla a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k verir. <code>.ewm(span=7).mean()</code> son noktalara \u00fcssel olarak daha y\u00fcksek etki verir.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\n<span class="cm"># Zaman serisi verisi olu\u015ftur</span>\nnp.random.<span class="fn">seed</span>(<span class="num">42</span>)\ntarihler = pd.<span class="fn">date_range</span>(<span class="str">"2024-01-01"</span>, periods=<span class="num">90</span>, freq=<span class="str">"D"</span>)\ngurultu = np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">90</span>) * <span class="num">5</span>\ntrend = np.<span class="fn">linspace</span>(<span class="num">50</span>, <span class="num">80</span>, <span class="num">90</span>)\nts = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({<span class="str">"tarih"</span>: tarihler, <span class="str">"deger"</span>: trend + gurultu})\nts = ts.<span class="fn">set_index</span>(<span class="str">"tarih"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Hareketli ortalama (kayan ortalama)</span>\nts[<span class="str">"ho_7"</span>]  = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">7</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()\nts[<span class="str">"ho_21"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">21</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># Kayan standart sapma (oynakl\u0131k)</span>\nts[<span class="str">"kayan_std"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">7</span>).<span class="fn">std</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># Geni\u015fleyen ortalama (k\u00fcm\u00fclatif ortalama)</span>\nts[<span class="str">"kum_ort"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">expanding</span>().<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00dcssel a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 hareketli ortalama</span>\nts[<span class="str">"uaho_7"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">ewm</span>(span=<span class="num">7</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(ts.<span class="fn">tail</span>(<span class="num">10</span>))</code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>\u0130leri d\u00fczey kayan i\u015flemler</strong> -- \u00f6zel fonksiyonlar, min_periods ve merkezlenmi\u015f pencereler:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># min_periods: ge\u00e7erli sonu\u00e7 i\u00e7in minimum veri noktas\u0131</span>\nts[<span class="str">"ho_kismi"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">7</span>, min_periods=<span class="num">1</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># Merkezlenmi\u015f pencere (ileri ve geri bakar)</span>\nts[<span class="str">"ho_merkez"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">7</span>, center=<span class="kw">True</span>).<span class="fn">mean</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00d6zel kayan fonksiyon</span>\nts[<span class="str">"kayan_aralik"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">rolling</span>(window=<span class="num">7</span>).<span class="fn">apply</span>(\n    <span class="kw">lambda</span> w: w.<span class="fn">max</span>() - w.<span class="fn">min</span>(),\n    raw=<span class="kw">True</span>\n)\n\n<span class="cm"># K\u00fcm\u00fclatif istatistikler</span>\nts[<span class="str">"kum_toplam"</span>] = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">cumsum</span>()\nts[<span class="str">"kum_maks"</span>]   = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">cummax</span>()\nts[<span class="str">"kum_min"</span>]    = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">cummin</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># Y\u00fczde de\u011fi\u015fim</span>\nts[<span class="str">"yuzde_deg"</span>]  = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">pct_change</span>()       <span class="cm"># g\u00fcnl\u00fck</span>\nts[<span class="str">"yuzde_7g"</span>]   = ts[<span class="str">"deger"</span>].<span class="fn">pct_change</span>(<span class="num">7</span>)     <span class="cm"># haftal\u0131k</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Hareketli Ortalama TR --- */
+ '<div id="plot-rolling-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var n=90;var raw=[];var ma7=[];var ma21=[];var ewm7=[];'
+ 'var rng=function(s){var x=Math.sin(s)*10000;return x-Math.floor(x)};'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var trend=50+i*30/90;var noise=(rng(i+42)-0.5)*10;raw.push(Math.round((trend+noise)*10)/10)}'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){if(i<6){ma7.push(null)}else{var s=0;for(var j=i-6;j<=i;j++)s+=raw[j];ma7.push(Math.round(s/7*10)/10)}}'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<n;i++){if(i<20){ma21.push(null)}else{var s=0;for(var j=i-20;j<=i;j++)s+=raw[j];ma21.push(Math.round(s/21*10)/10)}}'
+ 'var alpha=2/(7+1);ewm7[0]=raw[0];for(var i=1;i<n;i++){ewm7.push(Math.round((alpha*raw[i]+(1-alpha)*ewm7[i-1])*10)/10)}'
+ 'var days=[];for(var i=0;i<n;i++){var d=new Date(2024,0,1+i);days.push(d.toISOString().slice(0,10))}'
+ 'var t1={x:days,y:raw,name:"Ham",type:"scatter",mode:"lines",line:{color:"rgba(200,169,110,0.3)",width:1}};'
+ 'var t2={x:days,y:ma7,name:"7 G\u00fcn HO",type:"scatter",mode:"lines",line:{color:"#4de87a",width:2}};'
+ 'var t3={x:days,y:ma21,name:"21 G\u00fcn HO",type:"scatter",mode:"lines",line:{color:"#a78bfa",width:2}};'
+ 'var t4={x:days,y:ewm7,name:"\u00dcAHO (span=7)",type:"scatter",mode:"lines",line:{color:"#f87171",width:2,dash:"dash"}};'
+ 'var layout={title:{text:"Pencere Fonksiyonlar\u0131: Kayan ve \u00dcssel Hareketli Ortalamalar",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:14}},paper_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",plot_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},xaxis:{title:"Tarih",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},yaxis:{title:"De\u011fer",gridcolor:"rgba(255,255,255,0.06)"},legend:{x:0.01,y:0.99,bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0.3)"},margin:{t:50,r:30,b:60,l:50}};'
+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-rolling-tr",[t1,t2,t3,t4],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Soluk alt\u0131n \u00e7izgi ham g\u00fcr\u00fclt\u00fcl\u00fc veridir. Ye\u015fil \u00e7izgi 7 g\u00fcnl\u00fck kayan ortalama (k\u0131sa vadeli trend), mor \u00e7izgi 21 g\u00fcnl\u00fck kayan ortalama (uzun vadeli trend) ve kesikli k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \u00e7izgi \u00fcssel a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 ortalamad\u0131r (son verilere a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k veren d\u00fczle\u015ftirme). Daha uzun pencereler daha p\u00fcr\u00fczs\u00fcz e\u011friler \u00fcretir ama de\u011fi\u015fikliklere daha yava\u015f tepki verir.</div></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">PRAT\u0130K: Pencerelerle ML \u00d6znitelik M\u00fchendisli\u011fi</div><div class="example-body">'
+ '<strong>ML modelleri i\u00e7in zaman serisi \u00f6znitelikleri:</strong><br>'
+ '<code>df["ho_7"] = df.groupby("kategori")["deger"].transform(lambda x: x.rolling(7).mean())</code> -- kategori ba\u015f\u0131na hareketli ortalama<br>'
+ '<code>df["oynaklik"] = df.groupby("kategori")["deger"].transform(lambda x: x.rolling(14).std())</code> -- kayan oynakl\u0131k<br>'
+ '<code>df["momentum"] = df["deger"].pct_change(7)</code> -- 7 d\u00f6nem momentum<br>'
+ '<code>df["ho_ustu"] = (df["deger"] > df["ho_7"]).astype(int)</code> -- ikili trend g\u00f6stergesi<br>'
+ '<code>df["tepeden_uzaklik"] = df["deger"] / df["deger"].expanding().max()</code> -- zirveden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fc\u015f'
+ '</div></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Performans ipucu:</strong> Kayan/geni\u015fleyen i\u015flemlerde <code>.apply()</code>\'a <code>raw=True</code> ge\u00e7irin. Bu, fonksiyonunuza Series yerine NumPy dizisi verir ve \u00f6nemli \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcde daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r.</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">GROUPBY KOPYA KA\u011eIDI</div><div class="example-body">'
+ '<strong>Temel:</strong> <code>df.groupby("col")</code> | <code>df.groupby(["a","b"])</code> | <code>.groups</code> | <code>.ngroups</code> | <code>.get_group("x")</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Toplula\u015ft\u0131rma:</strong> <code>.mean()</code> | <code>.sum()</code> | <code>.count()</code> | <code>.agg(["mean","std"])</code> | <code>.agg(ad=("col","func"))</code><br>'
+ '<strong>D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme:</strong> <code>.transform("mean")</code> | <code>.transform(lambda x: (x-x.mean())/x.std())</code> | <code>.rank()</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Filtre:</strong> <code>.filter(lambda g: g["col"].mean() > esik)</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Pivot:</strong> <code>pd.pivot_table(df, values, index, columns, aggfunc)</code> | <code>margins=True</code><br>'
+ '<strong>\u00c7apraz tablo:</strong> <code>pd.crosstab(df["a"], df["b"])</code> | <code>normalize="index"</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Gruplama:</strong> <code>pd.cut(s, bins)</code> (e\u015fit geni\u015flik) | <code>pd.qcut(s, q)</code> (e\u015fit frekans)<br>'
+ '<strong>Pencere:</strong> <code>.rolling(7).mean()</code> | <code>.expanding().sum()</code> | <code>.ewm(span=7).mean()</code><br>'
+ '<strong>K\u00fcm\u00fclatif:</strong> <code>.cumsum()</code> | <code>.cummax()</code> | <code>.cummin()</code> | <code>.pct_change()</code>'
+ '</div></div>'

+ '<div class="l-warn"><strong>Sonraki Ders:</strong> Ders 6, <strong>Birle\u015ftirme, Joining ve Concatenation</strong> konular\u0131n\u0131 kapsar -- <code>merge()</code>, <code>join()</code> ve <code>concat()</code> ile birden fazla DataFrame\'i birle\u015ftirme. Inner, outer, left ve right join\'ler, \u00e7oklu anahtar birle\u015ftirmeler ve tekrar eden anahtarlar\u0131n y\u00f6netimi.</div>'

